      "html": "<body>\r\n<cb:mulu level=\"1\" n=\"16\" type=\"會\">16 菩薩見實會</cb:mulu><cb:mulu level=\"2\" n=\"9\" type=\"品\">9 乾闥婆授記品</cb:mulu><cb:div type=\"hui\">\r\n<milestone n=\"65\" unit=\"juan\"/>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371a17\">0371a17</span>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371a18\">0371a18</span><cb:div type=\"pin\">\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371a19\">0371a19</span><cb:juan n=\"065\" fun=\"open\"><cb:mulu n=\"065\" type=\"卷\"></cb:mulu><cb:jhead><title>大寶積經</title>卷第六十五</cb:jhead></cb:juan>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371a20\">0371a20</span>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371a21\">0371a21</span><byline cb:type=\"Translator\"><anchor xml:id=\"fxT11p0371a01\"/>北齊三藏那連提耶舍譯</byline>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371a22\">0371a22</span><cb:mulu level=\"2\" n=\"10\" type=\"品\">10 夜叉授記品</cb:mulu><head><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0371003\">〔菩薩〕－【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0371003\">菩薩【大】，〔－〕【宮】</span><app n=\"0371003\"><p class=\"lg\">菩薩</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\"><space quantity=\"0\"/></rdg></app>見實會第十六之五<anchor type=\"circle\"/><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0371004\">不分卷【聖】【聖乙】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0371004\">不分卷【聖】【聖乙】</span>夜叉授記品\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371a23\">0371a23</span>第十</head>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371a24\">0371a24</span><p>爾時復有八億夜叉，見諸阿修羅、<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0371005\">伽＝迦【明】下同</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0371005\">伽【大】下同，迦【明】下同</span><app n=\"0371005\"><p class=\"lg\">伽</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【明】\">迦</rdg></app>樓羅、龍\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371a25\">0371a25</span>女、龍王、鳩槃<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0371006\">荼＝茶【元】【明】下同</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0371006\">荼【大】下同，茶【元】【明】下同</span><app n=\"0371006\"><p class=\"lg\">荼</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【元】 【明】\">茶</rdg></app>、乾闥婆等，供養如來聞授記\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371a26\">0371a26</span>已，欣喜踊悅皆得稱心，生希有心得未曾有。\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371a27\">0371a27</span>知佛世尊智慧無盡、最尊、最<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0371a2701\">勝無【CB】【麗-CB】，無勝【大】</span><app n=\"0371a2701\"><p class=\"lg\">勝、無<note type=\"cf1\">K06n0022_p0515a08</note></lem><rdg wit=\"【大】\">無勝</rdg></app>所罣礙、不可\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371a28\">0371a28</span>思議，復更得聞法門次第，於佛世尊作導師\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371a29\">0371a29</span>想，復於佛所作無盡慧想。彼諸夜叉知佛智\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371b01\">0371b01</span>慧無有盡已，於佛正法生愛樂心。彼於佛法\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371b02\">0371b02</span>甚愛樂已，為供養故發勤精進，亦以偈讚\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371b03\">0371b03</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0371007\">〔曰〕－【聖】【聖乙】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0371007\">曰【大】，〔－〕【聖】【聖乙】</span><app n=\"0371007\"><p class=\"lg\">曰</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【聖】 【聖乙】\"><space quantity=\"0\"/></rdg></app>：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371b04\">0371b04</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「我等今讚利世者，<caesura/>以佛智力具足故，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371b05\">0371b05</span><p class=\"lg\">無盡無量如大海，<caesura/>故人師子身無等。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371b06\">0371b06</span><p class=\"lg\">須彌可得知輕重，<caesura/>虛空可得知廣狹，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371b07\">0371b07</span><p class=\"lg\">如來所有智慧力，<caesura/>一切不能得測量。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371b08\">0371b08</span><p class=\"lg\">知諸眾生敬信心，<caesura/>是故應<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0371008\">受＝度【三】【宮】【聖】【聖乙】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0371008\">受【大】，度【宋】【元】【明】【宮】【聖】【聖乙】</span><app n=\"0371008\"><p class=\"lg\">受</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】 【聖】 【聖乙】\">度</rdg></app>皆已度，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371b09\">0371b09</span><p class=\"lg\">於其度者知所趣，<caesura/>故佛無比亦無等。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371b10\">0371b10</span><p class=\"lg\">隨彼所修善惡界，<caesura/>一切生處受其身，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371b11\">0371b11</span><p class=\"lg\">知彼根信所應受，<caesura/>故佛無比亦無等。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371b12\">0371b12</span><p class=\"lg\">貪欲惡行瞋恚行，<caesura/>及以癡行佛悉知，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371b13\">0371b13</span><p class=\"lg\">憍慢嫉妬亦如是，<caesura/>故佛無比亦無等。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371b14\">0371b14</span><p class=\"lg\">眾生於此多所失，<caesura/>如來善知彼業道，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371b15\">0371b15</span><p class=\"lg\">世尊知彼甚捷利，<caesura/>故佛無比亦無等。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371b16\">0371b16</span><p class=\"lg\">善逝善見諸世間，<caesura/>隨其方面所失者，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371b17\">0371b17</span><p class=\"lg\">及以語言所喪失，<caesura/>世尊見彼悉無餘。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371b18\">0371b18</span><p class=\"lg\">於六道中幾時住，<caesura/>隨彼多少所受苦，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371b19\">0371b19</span><p class=\"lg\">及其所受種種身，<caesura/>世尊一切悉知見。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371b20\">0371b20</span><p class=\"lg\">隨其煩惱力所起，<caesura/>造作方便及與業，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371b21\">0371b21</span><p class=\"lg\">隨業所受種種苦，<caesura/>導師一切悉了知。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371b22\">0371b22</span><p class=\"lg\">隨其所求解脫道，<caesura/>於佛法中已出家，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371b23\">0371b23</span><p class=\"lg\">精勤修學聖道已，<caesura/>盡諸煩惱佛悉知。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371b24\">0371b24</span><p class=\"lg\">於佛法中有凡夫，<caesura/>雖得出家不知義，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371b25\">0371b25</span><p class=\"lg\">誹謗明人微妙法，<caesura/>世尊亦復善見彼。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371b26\">0371b26</span><p class=\"lg\">彼諸誹謗正法人，<caesura/>業行所得眾苦惱，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371b27\">0371b27</span><p class=\"lg\">隨其地獄久近住，<caesura/>如來亦能具足知。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371b28\">0371b28</span><p class=\"lg\">於佛深得敬信已，<caesura/>出家受持正法藏，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371b29\">0371b29</span><p class=\"lg\">觀察諸法皆悉空，<caesura/>斷除一切諸有道。</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371c01\">0371c01</span><p class=\"lg\">不願一切諸趣身，<caesura/>觀察此身猶如幻，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371c02\">0371c02</span><p class=\"lg\">知諸音聲亦如響，<caesura/>堅住道者佛亦知。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371c03\">0371c03</span><p class=\"lg\">讚歎無等大導師，<caesura/>我今所得福德聚，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371c04\">0371c04</span><p class=\"lg\">以此福德願成佛，<caesura/>亦願眾生成自然。」</p></lg>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371c05\">0371c05</span><p>爾時世尊知夜叉眾深心信已，現微笑相。爾\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371c06\">0371c06</span>時慧命馬勝比丘以偈問曰：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371c07\">0371c07</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「人中師子所現笑，<caesura/>唯願說其笑因緣，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371c08\">0371c08</span><p class=\"lg\">一切諸佛非無因，<caesura/>而現微笑人中<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0371009\">月＝有【聖】【聖乙】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0371009\">月【大】，有【聖】【聖乙】</span><app n=\"0371009\"><p class=\"lg\">月</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【聖】 【聖乙】\">有</rdg></app>。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371c09\">0371c09</span><p class=\"lg\">今此大眾皆懷疑，<caesura/>以見導師微笑故，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371c10\">0371c10</span><p class=\"lg\">唯願世<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0371010\">尊＝親【宮】【聖】【聖乙】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0371010\">尊【大】，親【宮】【聖】【聖乙】</span><app n=\"0371010\"><p class=\"lg\">尊</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】 【聖】 【聖乙】\">親</rdg></app>除其疑，<caesura/>皆令此眾得欣喜。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371c11\">0371c11</span><p class=\"lg\">今於佛所得信者，<caesura/>及知微妙正法者，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371c12\">0371c12</span><p class=\"lg\">其心堅固不動者，<caesura/>願佛宣說令彼聞。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371c13\">0371c13</span><p class=\"lg\">此諸大眾皆懷疑，<caesura/>一切瞻仰如來面，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371c14\">0371c14</span><p class=\"lg\">今日當有何等事，<caesura/>唯願世尊斷彼疑。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371c15\">0371c15</span><p class=\"lg\">今日誰現大神力，<caesura/>今日誰發大精進，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371c16\">0371c16</span><p class=\"lg\">今日佛共誰親友，<caesura/>於此大眾願顯現。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371c17\">0371c17</span><p class=\"lg\">善哉牟尼愍世間，<caesura/>唯願斷除諸疑惑，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371c18\">0371c18</span><p class=\"lg\">天人大眾若得聞，<caesura/>今日必當大欣喜。」</p></lg>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371c19\">0371c19</span><p>爾時世尊以偈答慧命馬勝曰：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371c20\">0371c20</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「善哉馬勝汝所問，<caesura/>今當大利諸世間，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371c21\">0371c21</span><p class=\"lg\">由汝能問笑因緣，<caesura/>故歎汝善解我意。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371c22\">0371c22</span><p class=\"lg\">我今盡當答彼義，<caesura/>汝當一心專諦聽，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371c23\">0371c23</span><p class=\"lg\">知諸夜叉心意已，<caesura/>我為世間現微笑。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371c24\">0371c24</span><p class=\"lg\">夜叉諸眾心敬信，<caesura/>以知菩提寂滅故，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371c25\">0371c25</span><p class=\"lg\">歎佛真實功德已，<caesura/>發心趣向大菩提。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371c26\">0371c26</span><p class=\"lg\">為知諸法空寂故，<caesura/>除遣一切所有相，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371c27\">0371c27</span><p class=\"lg\">於諸趣中願捨已，<caesura/>發心趣向大菩提。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371c28\">0371c28</span><p class=\"lg\">以禪定力知諸陰，<caesura/>但是世諦不取著，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371c29\">0371c29</span><p class=\"lg\">不著諸有如蓮花，<caesura/>發心趣向大菩提。</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372a01\">0372a01</span><p class=\"lg\">於諸有中障礙事，<caesura/>彼見空故不為縛，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372a02\">0372a02</span><p class=\"lg\">知佛菩提無上已，<caesura/>彼等能修菩提行。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372a03\">0372a03</span><p class=\"lg\">諸生老死皆悉空，<caesura/>此即無上菩提道，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372a04\">0372a04</span><p class=\"lg\">知法自性空寂已，<caesura/>能得安隱大菩提。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372a05\">0372a05</span><p class=\"lg\">知陰自性空寂已，<caesura/>寂靜菩提性亦<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0372001\">難＝離【三】【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0372001\">離【CB】【思溪-CB】【磧乙-CB】【宋】【元】【明】【宮】，難【大】</span><app n=\"0372001\"><p class=\"lg\">離<note type=\"cf1\">《思溪藏》（中國國家圖書館藏第699冊第9圖第1行）</note><note type=\"cf2\">磧砂藏 QC016n0023_p0499b06</note></lem><rdg wit=\"【大】\">難</rdg><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】\">離</rdg></app>，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372a06\">0372a06</span><p class=\"lg\">所修菩提行亦空，<caesura/>此智能知非凡了。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372a07\">0372a07</span><p class=\"lg\">能觀智慧性自空，<caesura/>所觀境界皆寂滅，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372a08\">0372a08</span><p class=\"lg\">知者亦空知是已，<caesura/>是人能修菩提道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372a09\">0372a09</span><p class=\"lg\">當知空亦性自空，<caesura/>相願亦復無體性，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372a10\">0372a10</span><p class=\"lg\">若有人能如是知，<caesura/>是人能修真實行。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372a11\">0372a11</span><p class=\"lg\">天人大眾聞是已，<caesura/>心生欣喜獲利益，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372a12\">0372a12</span><p class=\"lg\">一切於佛敬信已，<caesura/>心住菩提寂靜句。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372a13\">0372a13</span><p class=\"lg\">今此殊勝供養已，<caesura/>夜叉之眾心清淨，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372a14\">0372a14</span><p class=\"lg\">此諸智者捨鬼道，<caesura/>於善趣中久受樂。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372a15\">0372a15</span><p class=\"lg\">彼於未來多億佛，<caesura/>以神通力一念中，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372a16\">0372a16</span><p class=\"lg\">於多佛土修供養，<caesura/>即於佛所獲得忍。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372a17\">0372a17</span><p class=\"lg\">於諸世界不起相，<caesura/>智者能以神力往，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372a18\">0372a18</span><p class=\"lg\">觀此世間猶如化，<caesura/>智者遊行無所著。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372a19\">0372a19</span><p class=\"lg\">此等勇猛供諸佛，<caesura/>當得無上大菩提，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372a20\">0372a20</span><p class=\"lg\">亦得無上淨佛土，<caesura/>其中當度無量眾。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372a21\">0372a21</span><p class=\"lg\">彼等當成世間解，<caesura/>一切同號無邊智，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372a22\">0372a22</span><p class=\"lg\">名聞十方壽千劫，<caesura/>寂滅智慧壽命等。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372a23\">0372a23</span><p class=\"lg\">彼等所有聲聞眾，<caesura/>猶如靜夜諸星宿，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372a24\">0372a24</span><p class=\"lg\">彼悉易得大菩提，<caesura/>一切無有苦難事。」</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372a25\">0372a25</span><p class=\"lg\">天人大眾聞是已，<caesura/>為於菩提心踊悅，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372a26\">0372a26</span><p class=\"lg\">其心堅固發精勤，<caesura/>以精進力持諸行。<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0372002\">卷第六十四終【聖】【聖乙】，光明皇后願文【聖】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0372002\">卷第六十四終【聖】【聖乙】，光明皇后願文【聖】</span><anchor type=\"circle\"/></p></lg></cb:div>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372a27\">0372a27</span><cb:div type=\"pin\"><cb:mulu level=\"2\" n=\"11\" type=\"品\">11 緊那羅授記品</cb:mulu><head><anchor type=\"circle\"/><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0372003\">卷第六十五首，＋（大寶積經菩薩見實會第十六之五卷六十五，北齊三藏那連提耶舍譯）【聖】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0372003\">〔－〕【大】，（大寶積經菩薩見實會第十六之五卷六十五，北齊三藏那連提耶舍譯）【聖】，卷第六十五首</span>緊那羅授記品第十一</head>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372a28\">0372a28</span><p>爾時復有八億緊那羅眾，大樹緊那羅王以\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372a29\">0372a29</span>為上首，見諸阿修羅、伽樓羅、龍女、龍王、鳩槃\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372b01\">0372b01</span>荼、乾闥婆、夜叉等，供養如來及聞授記已，甚\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372b02\">0372b02</span>生希有未曾有心，作是思量：「此實希有未曾\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372b03\">0372b03</span>有事。以其眾生不可得故、無命者故、無生者\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372b04\">0372b04</span>故、無有人故、無摩那婆故、無養育故、無壽者\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372b05\">0372b05</span>故、無有我故、亦無我所故，以諸陰故名為\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372b06\">0372b06</span>眾生。一切諸陰亦不可得，以其界故名為眾\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372b07\">0372b07</span>生。一切諸界亦不可得，以有入故名為眾生。\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372b08\">0372b08</span>一切諸入亦不可得，以有業故<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0372004\">〔得〕－【宋】【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0372004\">得【大】，〔－〕【宋】【宮】</span><app n=\"0372004\"><p class=\"lg\">得</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【宮】\"><space quantity=\"0\"/></rdg></app>有果報。而\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372b09\">0372b09</span>彼行業亦不可得，無上菩提亦不可得，一切\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372b10\">0372b10</span>菩薩亦不可得，一切諸佛亦不可得。世尊雖\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372b11\">0372b11</span>爾而復與諸菩薩授記，以何義故如來與諸\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372b12\">0372b12</span>菩薩授記示其名號，顯現業報說其當來？菩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372b13\">0372b13</span>薩大眾復顯諸佛神通之力，又復說於正法\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372b14\">0372b14</span>之力，亦復顯現莊嚴佛土，宣說眾生有業有\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372b15\">0372b15</span>報，又復說於清淨佛剎，<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0372005\">示＝亦【三】【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0372005\">示【大】，亦【宋】【元】【明】【宮】</span><app n=\"0372005\"><p class=\"lg\">示</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】\">亦</rdg></app>顯菩薩遊諸佛國，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372b16\">0372b16</span>從一佛土至一佛土。復演菩薩往彼供養，亦\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372b17\">0372b17</span>說供養殊勝神變，又列供具微妙希有。又復\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372b18\">0372b18</span>說於經若干劫當得作佛，其佛住世經若干\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372b19\">0372b19</span>劫，其佛當有若干聲聞，彼佛滅後正法住世\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372b20\">0372b20</span>經若干劫。何故如來捨諸眾生入般涅槃？」</p><p>爾\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372b21\">0372b21</span>時大樹緊那羅王生此疑已，與八億緊那羅\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372b22\">0372b22</span>眾從座而起，偏袒右肩右膝著地，合掌向\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372b23\">0372b23</span>佛，以偈問曰：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372b24\">0372b24</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「我等聞佛所記已，<caesura/>甚生疑惑。大智慧！</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372b25\">0372b25</span><p class=\"lg\">既說授記復言空，<caesura/>我於二說不能解。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372b26\">0372b26</span><p class=\"lg\">既說空寂離自性，<caesura/>法界平等無變動，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372b27\">0372b27</span><p class=\"lg\">而復如來受供養，<caesura/>此事云何？眾中月！</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372b28\">0372b28</span><p class=\"lg\">佛既說於無有生，<caesura/>而復說發菩提心，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372b29\">0372b29</span><p class=\"lg\">於無量智二種說，<caesura/>此言祕密我不解。</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372c01\">0372c01</span><p class=\"lg\">云何言滅不可得，<caesura/>而人師子說有死？</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372c02\">0372c02</span><p class=\"lg\">唯願如實為記說，<caesura/>除斷我疑令無餘。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372c03\">0372c03</span><p class=\"lg\">云何佛說猶如幻，<caesura/>又復顯示生天中？</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372c04\">0372c04</span><p class=\"lg\">於釋師子如是說，<caesura/>此祕密教我不解。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372c05\">0372c05</span><p class=\"lg\">佛說諸法無所依，<caesura/>而復說依善知識，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372c06\">0372c06</span><p class=\"lg\">此是世尊祕密語，<caesura/>我實不解人中雄。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372c07\">0372c07</span><p class=\"lg\">云何說於無所堪，<caesura/>復教眾生修諸業？</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372c08\">0372c08</span><p class=\"lg\">降伏怨敵天中尊，<caesura/>祕密之說我不解。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372c09\">0372c09</span><p class=\"lg\">云何佛說性自空，<caesura/>復言觀空得解脫？</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372c10\">0372c10</span><p class=\"lg\">我今於此不能解，<caesura/>願無邊智斷我疑。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372c11\">0372c11</span><p class=\"lg\">云何佛說事盡滅，<caesura/>復說諸法性寂滅？</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372c12\">0372c12</span><p class=\"lg\">我今唯願無等等，<caesura/>開顯此等祕密說。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372c13\">0372c13</span><p class=\"lg\">云何端正<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0372006\">修＝須【元】【明】【宮】【聖】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0372006\">修【大】，須【元】【明】【宮】【聖】</span><app n=\"0372006\"><p class=\"lg\">修</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【元】 【明】 【宮】 【聖】\">須</rdg></app>伽陀，<caesura/>顯示諸法如虛空，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372c14\">0372c14</span><p class=\"lg\">而愚癡人毀謗法，<caesura/>死必墮於大地獄？</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372c15\">0372c15</span><p class=\"lg\">大雄恒說諸天道，<caesura/>又復說於諸餘趣，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372c16\">0372c16</span><p class=\"lg\">既言此等由<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0372007\">作＝化【宮】【聖】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0372007\">作【大】，化【宮】【聖】</span><app n=\"0372007\"><p class=\"lg\">作</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】 【聖】\">化</rdg></app>業，<caesura/>復道無有作業者。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372c17\">0372c17</span><p class=\"lg\">不可勝者所宣說，<caesura/>種種差別不可知，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372c18\">0372c18</span><p class=\"lg\">我今於此生疑惑，<caesura/>唯願世尊見除斷。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372c19\">0372c19</span><p class=\"lg\">既言善業無可集，<caesura/>復說修行得菩提，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372c20\">0372c20</span><p class=\"lg\">沙門法王如是說，<caesura/>此亦我等不能解。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372c21\">0372c21</span><p class=\"lg\">云何說法不可盡，<caesura/>而言謗者罪可畢？</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372c22\">0372c22</span><p class=\"lg\">無量智慧願開示，<caesura/>我於是中大有疑。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372c23\">0372c23</span><p class=\"lg\">如來既說真際法，<caesura/>復言顛倒及施等，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372c24\">0372c24</span><p class=\"lg\">無翳淨眼滅罪者，<caesura/>此義唯願為我說。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372c25\">0372c25</span><p class=\"lg\">餘無有能為我等，<caesura/>宣釋如是所疑事，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372c26\">0372c26</span><p class=\"lg\">唯有如來能斷除，<caesura/>是故我敬一切智。」</p></lg>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372c27\">0372c27</span><p>爾時世尊聞大樹緊那羅王等問諸疑已，以\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372c28\">0372c28</span>偈答曰：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0372c29\">0372c29</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「汝言說空復授記，<caesura/>於此二事不能解。</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373a01\">0373a01</span><p class=\"lg\">諸法若是不空者，<caesura/>佛不為其說授記。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373a02\">0373a02</span><p class=\"lg\">以何因緣如是說？<caesura/>諸法若有體性者，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373a03\">0373a03</span><p class=\"lg\">一切常住不可轉，<caesura/>彼應不減亦不增。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373a04\">0373a04</span><p class=\"lg\">諸法體性本自空，<caesura/>猶如平正清淨鏡，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373a05\">0373a05</span><p class=\"lg\">能<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0373001\">現＝見【宮】【聖】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0373001\">現【大】，見【宮】【聖】</span><app n=\"0373001\"><p class=\"lg\">現</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】 【聖】\">見</rdg></app>一切諸色像，<caesura/>如是當知一切法。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373a06\">0373a06</span><p class=\"lg\">法界無有變異相，<caesura/>汝於一切供養物，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373a07\">0373a07</span><p class=\"lg\">一一諸分當觀察，<caesura/>何等分中而有相？</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373a08\">0373a08</span><p class=\"lg\">法界常住無變異，<caesura/>智者應當如是觀，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373a09\">0373a09</span><p class=\"lg\">諸凡夫人悉迷惑，<caesura/>無智慧故不能解。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373a10\">0373a10</span><p class=\"lg\">汝言佛說無有生，<caesura/>復說發心為難解，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373a11\">0373a11</span><p class=\"lg\">汝等今當一心聽，<caesura/>十力所說祕密義。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373a12\">0373a12</span><p class=\"lg\">凡夫沒溺生死河，<caesura/>亦復繫心著彼處，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373a13\">0373a13</span><p class=\"lg\">心常懷於想顛倒，<caesura/>故受生死諸苦惱。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373a14\">0373a14</span><p class=\"lg\">從本已來未聞法，<caesura/>我若為彼定說者，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373a15\">0373a15</span><p class=\"lg\">凡夫愚人於此法，<caesura/>轉復增長諸疑惑。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373a16\">0373a16</span><p class=\"lg\">彼聞菩提勝利益，<caesura/>其心專注於彼果，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373a17\">0373a17</span><p class=\"lg\">其心又復生味著，<caesura/>自然勝智無能<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0373002\">過＝通【三】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0373002\">過【大】，通【宋】【元】【明】</span><app n=\"0373002\"><p class=\"lg\">過</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】\">通</rdg></app>。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373a18\">0373a18</span><p class=\"lg\">汝言無滅復有死，<caesura/>此二我今不能知，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373a19\">0373a19</span><p class=\"lg\">於此一心應諦聽，<caesura/>我當為汝真實說。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373a20\">0373a20</span><p class=\"lg\">為彼計常諸眾生，<caesura/>是故如來說於滅，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373a21\">0373a21</span><p class=\"lg\">恒見諸有皆衰壞，<caesura/>無有一法是常者。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373a22\">0373a22</span><p class=\"lg\">汝言諸法猶如幻，<caesura/>復言生天懷疑者，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373a23\">0373a23</span><p class=\"lg\">學人凡夫善趣等，<caesura/>是法不定故如幻。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373a24\">0373a24</span><p class=\"lg\">如汝所言無有依，<caesura/>復言依止善知識，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373a25\">0373a25</span><p class=\"lg\">欲求棄捨依止故，<caesura/>善友為說無所依。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373a26\">0373a26</span><p class=\"lg\">汝言畢竟無堪能，<caesura/>復言有作我不解，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373a27\">0373a27</span><p class=\"lg\">當觀車為眾分成，<caesura/>亦觀車有所作事。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373a28\">0373a28</span><p class=\"lg\">若復有人著於我，<caesura/>亦復取於我所為，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373a29\">0373a29</span><p class=\"lg\">我為是等說無堪，<caesura/>雖復如是非無作。</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373b01\">0373b01</span><p class=\"lg\">汝言一切性自空，<caesura/>復疑觀空得解脫，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373b02\">0373b02</span><p class=\"lg\">顛倒愚癡無智者，<caesura/>不能了知體性空。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373b03\">0373b03</span><p class=\"lg\">從於妄想分別生，<caesura/>虛妄攀緣故被縛，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373b04\">0373b04</span><p class=\"lg\">為化如是眾生故，<caesura/>善逝說於性非有。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373b05\">0373b05</span><p class=\"lg\">如汝所說事盡滅，<caesura/>一切諸法性亦滅，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373b06\">0373b06</span><p class=\"lg\">迷惑無智諸眾生，<caesura/>妄分別故生渴愛。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373b07\">0373b07</span><p class=\"lg\">譬如渴者見陽焰，<caesura/>以<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0373003\">憶＝億【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0373003\">憶【大】，億【宮】</span><app n=\"0373003\"><p class=\"lg\">憶</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">億</rdg></app>想故增長渴，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373b08\">0373b08</span><p class=\"lg\">愚人復為虛妄害，<caesura/>於無所有起分別。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373b09\">0373b09</span><p class=\"lg\">渴者妄生見水想，<caesura/>陽焰之處水本無，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373b10\">0373b10</span><p class=\"lg\">妄想所害諸眾生，<caesura/>於諸不淨起淨想。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373b11\">0373b11</span><p class=\"lg\">愚癡凡夫愛所縛，<caesura/>彼穢惡中性無淨，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373b12\">0373b12</span><p class=\"lg\">譬如陽焰似水相，<caesura/>彼中體性實無水。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373b13\">0373b13</span><p class=\"lg\">如是身中無淨色，<caesura/>身色亦復性非淨，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373b14\">0373b14</span><p class=\"lg\">愚癡凡夫顛倒見，<caesura/>妄作淨想而被縛。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373b15\">0373b15</span><p class=\"lg\">雖說諸法如虛空，<caesura/>亦說謗者墮地獄，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373b16\">0373b16</span><p class=\"lg\">愚人<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0373004\">聞＝間【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0373004\">聞【大】，間【宮】</span><app n=\"0373004\"><p class=\"lg\">聞</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">間</rdg></app>之生怖畏，<caesura/>智者雖聞心安隱。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373b17\">0373b17</span><p class=\"lg\">世間體性自空寂，<caesura/>愚癡無智起我想，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373b18\">0373b18</span><p class=\"lg\">彼等若聞性空教，<caesura/>怖畏不得更受生。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373b19\">0373b19</span><p class=\"lg\">彼等毀謗妙空法，<caesura/>皆由計著我見故，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373b20\">0373b20</span><p class=\"lg\">如人繫縛於虛空，<caesura/>是無智人墮地獄。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373b21\">0373b21</span><p class=\"lg\">我本所說諸善趣，<caesura/>及為世間說餘道，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373b22\">0373b22</span><p class=\"lg\">說有作業而不失，<caesura/>亦奪其執有作者。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373b23\">0373b23</span><p class=\"lg\">一切諸趣猶如夢，<caesura/>我為汝說如是知，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373b24\">0373b24</span><p class=\"lg\">夢中無有去來相，<caesura/>顛倒見者著去來。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373b25\">0373b25</span><p class=\"lg\">我既演說有作業，<caesura/>十方推求無作者，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373b26\">0373b26</span><p class=\"lg\">譬如猛風吹諸樹，<caesura/>其樹相觸則火出。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373b27\">0373b27</span><p class=\"lg\">其風及樹不作念，<caesura/>言謂我等能出火，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373b28\">0373b28</span><p class=\"lg\">雖復如是而火<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0373005\">生＝出【聖】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0373005\">生【大】，出【聖】</span><app n=\"0373005\"><p class=\"lg\">生</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【聖】\">出</rdg></app>，<caesura/>當知有業無作者。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373b29\">0373b29</span><p class=\"lg\">汝言福德無積聚，<caesura/>復云善得菩提果，</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373c01\">0373c01</span><p class=\"lg\">我今真實為汝說，<caesura/>汝當專諦至心聽。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373c02\">0373c02</span><p class=\"lg\">譬如世人得長壽，<caesura/>其命至於百餘歲，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373c03\">0373c03</span><p class=\"lg\">然彼歲數無聚積，<caesura/>一切緣集亦如是。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373c04\">0373c04</span><p class=\"lg\">汝言諸法無有盡，<caesura/>復言我說業可畢，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373c05\">0373c05</span><p class=\"lg\">觀空法者無有窮，<caesura/>隨世法故業有盡。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373c06\">0373c06</span><p class=\"lg\">我雖說有實際法，<caesura/>顛倒亦非實際外，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373c07\">0373c07</span><p class=\"lg\">顛倒愚癡眾生輩，<caesura/>不能了知真實際。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373c08\">0373c08</span><p class=\"lg\">緊那羅王當諦聽，<caesura/>為具智慧勤進者，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373c09\">0373c09</span><p class=\"lg\">一切諸相皆一相，<caesura/>所謂無相應當知。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373c10\">0373c10</span><p class=\"lg\">若能解入於一字，<caesura/>我為智者說菩提，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373c11\">0373c11</span><p class=\"lg\">一切諸法皆無作，<caesura/>此說阿字總持門。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373c12\">0373c12</span><p class=\"lg\">一切菩薩之所行，<caesura/>無邊之相我已說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373c13\">0373c13</span><p class=\"lg\">此亦能入一切法，<caesura/>所謂阿字總持門。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373c14\">0373c14</span><p class=\"lg\">一切諸法皆寂滅，<caesura/>示阿字門令得入，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373c15\">0373c15</span><p class=\"lg\">樹緊那羅應當知，<caesura/>此亦阿字總持門。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373c16\">0373c16</span><p class=\"lg\">一切諸法無分別，<caesura/>入此法門已宣說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373c17\">0373c17</span><p class=\"lg\">緊那羅王應當知，<caesura/>此亦阿字總持門。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373c18\">0373c18</span><p class=\"lg\">一切諸法無自性，<caesura/>示阿字門令得入，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373c19\">0373c19</span><p class=\"lg\">樹緊那羅應當知，<caesura/>此亦阿字總持門。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373c20\">0373c20</span><p class=\"lg\">一切諸法無有邊，<caesura/>以阿字門說諸法，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373c21\">0373c21</span><p class=\"lg\">緊那羅王應當知，<caesura/>此亦阿字總持門。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373c22\">0373c22</span><p class=\"lg\">盡無盡法我已說，<caesura/>應說一切法無盡，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373c23\">0373c23</span><p class=\"lg\">一切十<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0373006\">方＝力【三】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0373006\">方【大】，力【宋】【元】【明】</span><app n=\"0373006\"><p class=\"lg\">方</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】\">力</rdg></app>諸如來，<caesura/>已說無盡總持門。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373c24\">0373c24</span><p class=\"lg\">一切諸法無有門，<caesura/>物無有故現非有，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373c25\">0373c25</span><p class=\"lg\">此亦即是總持門，<caesura/>由是能入阿字門。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373c26\">0373c26</span><p class=\"lg\">於諸不可思議法，<caesura/>諸佛依實能顯示，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373c27\">0373c27</span><p class=\"lg\">樹緊那羅應當知，<caesura/>此亦阿字陀羅尼。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373c28\">0373c28</span><p class=\"lg\">一切諸法無所趣，<caesura/>我為智者說菩提，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0373c29\">0373c29</span><p class=\"lg\">此亦即是總持門，<caesura/>是阿字門應當入。</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374a01\">0374a01</span><p class=\"lg\">一切諸法無有來，<caesura/>若不修者則不得，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374a02\">0374a02</span><p class=\"lg\">此亦是其總持門，<caesura/>是阿字門應當入。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374a03\">0374a03</span><p class=\"lg\">諸法假名皆當有，<caesura/>推其自性不可得，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374a04\">0374a04</span><p class=\"lg\">此亦是其總持門，<caesura/>是阿字門應當入。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374a05\">0374a05</span><p class=\"lg\">一切諸法無自性，<caesura/>推其自性不可得，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374a06\">0374a06</span><p class=\"lg\">此亦是其總持門，<caesura/>是陀羅尼佛所說。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374a07\">0374a07</span><p class=\"lg\">一切諸法不可得，<caesura/>以法自性無故然，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374a08\">0374a08</span><p class=\"lg\">此亦是其總持門，<caesura/>是阿字門應當入。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374a09\">0374a09</span><p class=\"lg\">樹緊那羅應當聽，<caesura/>一切諸法離思念，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374a10\">0374a10</span><p class=\"lg\">此亦是其總持門，<caesura/>是陀羅尼善逝說。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374a11\">0374a11</span><p class=\"lg\">諸佛世尊已顯示，<caesura/>法無實故無障礙，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374a12\">0374a12</span><p class=\"lg\">此亦是其總持門，<caesura/>當入阿字陀羅尼。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374a13\">0374a13</span><p class=\"lg\">一切諸法無障礙，<caesura/>無有能障諸法者，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374a14\">0374a14</span><p class=\"lg\">此亦是其總持門，<caesura/>入阿字門我已說。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374a15\">0374a15</span><p class=\"lg\">一切諸法無有生，<caesura/>智者當知唯一相，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374a16\">0374a16</span><p class=\"lg\">彼一切法無生者，<caesura/>當知是法無有名。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374a17\">0374a17</span><p class=\"lg\">一切諸法無有生，<caesura/>其生本來不可得，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374a18\">0374a18</span><p class=\"lg\">此亦是其總持門，<caesura/>是阿字門應當入。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374a19\">0374a19</span><p class=\"lg\">若法無實無生者，<caesura/>不可覩見不可示，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374a20\">0374a20</span><p class=\"lg\">諸法自性不可得，<caesura/>是故無有能見者。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374a21\">0374a21</span><p class=\"lg\">一切諸法無有比，<caesura/>是故一相無有相，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374a22\">0374a22</span><p class=\"lg\">譬如虛空無有等，<caesura/>一切諸法亦復然。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374a23\">0374a23</span><p class=\"lg\">一切諸法無增減，<caesura/>非一非二非<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0374001\">焦＝熱【明】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0374001\">焦【大】，熱【明】</span><app n=\"0374001\"><p class=\"lg\">焦</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【明】\">熱</rdg></app>惱，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374a24\">0374a24</span><p class=\"lg\">亦非是冷復非熱，<caesura/>以非有故不可見。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374a25\">0374a25</span><p class=\"lg\">無有曲相及直相，<caesura/>亦復無有明闇相，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374a26\">0374a26</span><p class=\"lg\">亦無見聞諸相等，<caesura/>是無所有陀羅尼。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374a27\">0374a27</span><p class=\"lg\">非是諂曲非正直，<caesura/>無有卷舒諸相等，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374a28\">0374a28</span><p class=\"lg\">亦無瞋恚及欣喜，<caesura/>復無起作與寂滅。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374a29\">0374a29</span><p class=\"lg\">無有入相及出相，<caesura/>無進無退無來往，</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374b01\">0374b01</span><p class=\"lg\">亦復無眠及無寤，<caesura/>離覺知相應當知。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374b02\">0374b02</span><p class=\"lg\"><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0374002\">非是…記說∞願為…調伏 P.375A【宋】【元】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0374002\">非是…記說【大】∞願為…調伏 P.375A【宋】【元】</span>非是其眼復非盲，<caesura/>無有能見及暗障，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374b03\">0374b03</span><p class=\"lg\">亦無開相及閉相，<caesura/>非是調伏非不調。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374b04\">0374b04</span><p class=\"lg\">非是掉動及止息，<caesura/>亦非世間非涅槃，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374b05\">0374b05</span><p class=\"lg\">非是真實非虛妄，<caesura/>如是當知佛境界。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374b06\">0374b06</span><p class=\"lg\">為欲調伏世間故，<caesura/>斷除汝疑我無疑，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374b07\">0374b07</span><p class=\"lg\">第一義中無人能，<caesura/>除斷一切他疑網。」</p></lg>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374b08\">0374b08</span><p>爾時大樹緊那羅王聞佛說於總持之門，心\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374b09\">0374b09</span>大欣喜。既欣喜已發勇猛心，即時化作八億\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374b10\">0374b10</span>重閣。此諸重閣或在樹上、或蓮花上、或在山\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374b11\">0374b11</span>上，皆是七寶之所莊嚴。彼諸重閣，皆以種種\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374b12\">0374b12</span>眾寶之蓋種種寶幢而用莊嚴，復以種種寶\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374b13\">0374b13</span>花<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0374003\">旒＝流【明】＊</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0374003\">旒【大】＊，流【明】＊</span><app n=\"0374003\"><p class=\"lg\">旒</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【明】\">流</rdg></app>蘇、種種雜色繒綵旒蘇而為莊飾。爾\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374b14\">0374b14</span>時大樹緊<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0374004\">那＝陀【宋】【元】【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0374004\">那【大】，陀【宋】【元】【宮】</span><app n=\"0374004\"><p class=\"lg\">那</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【宮】\">陀</rdg></app>羅王并及八億緊那羅眾，持香\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374b15\">0374b15</span>山中所有水陸一切諸花以散佛上。既散佛\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374b16\">0374b16</span>已，一一各昇七寶重閣遶佛三匝，復以水陸\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374b17\">0374b17</span>所有諸花重散如來，復遶三匝。爾時大樹緊\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374b18\">0374b18</span>那羅王及與八億緊那羅眾，從重閣下復遶\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374b19\">0374b19</span>三匝，頂禮佛足一心合掌，瞻仰世尊目不暫\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374b20\">0374b20</span>捨，却住一面，思念如來過去現在無量功\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374b21\">0374b21</span>德。</p><p>爾時世尊知大樹緊那羅王及八億眾深\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374b22\">0374b22</span>心樂欲，現微笑相。爾時慧命馬勝比丘以偈\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374b23\">0374b23</span>問曰：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374b24\">0374b24</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「善逝非是無緣笑，<caesura/>天人所供如實說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374b25\">0374b25</span><p class=\"lg\">眾覩佛笑悉懷疑，<caesura/><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0374005\">眾＝今【明】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0374005\">眾【大】，今【明】</span><app n=\"0374005\"><p class=\"lg\">眾</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【明】\">今</rdg></app>見最勝如初月。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374b26\">0374b26</span><p class=\"lg\">妙色世尊誰今日，<caesura/>於無二法起勝慧？</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374b27\">0374b27</span><p class=\"lg\">我於今日懷疑惑，<caesura/>唯願人尊除我疑。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374b28\">0374b28</span><p class=\"lg\">誰於佛法得淨心，<caesura/>如來由彼現微笑？</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374c01\">0374c01</span><p class=\"lg\">唯願如來為記說，<caesura/>言說中勝斷我疑。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374c02\">0374c02</span><p class=\"lg\">是時一切諸大眾，<caesura/><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0374006\">若＝善【宋】【元】【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0374006\">若【大】，善【宋】【元】【宮】</span><app n=\"0374006\"><p class=\"lg\">若</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【宮】\">善</rdg></app>聞佛說皆欣喜，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374c03\">0374c03</span><p class=\"lg\">願除彼等諸疑惑，<caesura/>如佛所教皆能行。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374c04\">0374c04</span><p class=\"lg\">是故最勝兩足尊，<caesura/>除斷疑惑為記說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374c05\">0374c05</span><p class=\"lg\"><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0374007\">非是…記說∞願為…調伏 P.375A【宋】【元】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0374007\">願為…調伏 P.375A【大】∞非是…記說【宋】【元】</span>願為緊那羅王等，<caesura/>及為一切諸眾生。」</p></lg>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374c06\">0374c06</span><p>爾時世尊復以偈頌答馬勝言：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374c07\">0374c07</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「善哉馬勝知時問，<caesura/>我今為汝分別說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374c08\">0374c08</span><p class=\"lg\">由汝問故我顯示，<caesura/>眾人當得佛功德。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374c09\">0374c09</span><p class=\"lg\">汝當清淨專一心，<caesura/>聽希有事勿亂意，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374c10\">0374c10</span><p class=\"lg\">所謂善逝最勝智，<caesura/>無有障礙大知見。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374c11\">0374c11</span><p class=\"lg\">緊那羅王設疑問，<caesura/>為利一切諸眾生，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374c12\">0374c12</span><p class=\"lg\">我今說彼當來果，<caesura/>諦聽我當斷汝疑。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374c13\">0374c13</span><p class=\"lg\">樹緊那羅八億等，<caesura/>王及臣民諸眷屬，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374c14\">0374c14</span><p class=\"lg\">是等於我供養已，<caesura/>從此命終生天上。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374c15\">0374c15</span><p class=\"lg\"><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0374c1501\">從【CB】【麗-CB】，徒【大】</span><app n=\"0374c1501\"><p class=\"lg\">從<note type=\"cf1\">K06n0022_p0519c02</note></lem><rdg wit=\"【大】\">徒</rdg></app>此已後九億劫，<caesura/>流轉在於人天中，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374c16\">0374c16</span><p class=\"lg\">具足修習五神通，<caesura/>得智自在心自在。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374c17\">0374c17</span><p class=\"lg\">彼於那由他佛剎，<caesura/>是人師子<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0374008\">遭化生＝遣化往【三】【宮】，遣化生【聖】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0374008\">遭化生【大】，遣化往【宋】【元】【明】【宮】，遣化生【聖】</span><app n=\"0374008\"><p class=\"lg\">遭化生</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】\">遣化往</rdg><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【聖】\">遣化生</rdg></app>，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374c18\">0374c18</span><p class=\"lg\">身處天宮而不動，<caesura/>恒受禪悅安隱樂。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374c19\">0374c19</span><p class=\"lg\">彼於九十千萬劫，<caesura/>在於人天流轉已，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374c20\">0374c20</span><p class=\"lg\">各各自於佛剎中，<caesura/>皆得成於無上道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374c21\">0374c21</span><p class=\"lg\">其劫號曰常照曜，<caesura/>於彼劫中成佛道，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374c22\">0374c22</span><p class=\"lg\">此皆一生補處人，<caesura/>彼智慧者當得佛。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374c23\">0374c23</span><p class=\"lg\">彼佛國土無一人，<caesura/>非是修行成熟者，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374c24\">0374c24</span><p class=\"lg\">皆是一生補處人，<caesura/>無求聲聞二乘者。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374c25\">0374c25</span><p class=\"lg\">一切皆是大菩薩，<caesura/>為世明者悉生彼，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374c26\">0374c26</span><p class=\"lg\">悉是一生補處人，<caesura/>後當皆得成佛道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374c27\">0374c27</span><p class=\"lg\">彼土諸大菩薩眾，<caesura/>安住弘誓大願中，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374c28\">0374c28</span><p class=\"lg\">我於無量諸佛剎，<caesura/>皆悉修治令清淨。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0374c29\">0374c29</span><p class=\"lg\">彼菩薩願甚廣大，<caesura/>於長夜中善思量，</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0375a01\">0375a01</span><p class=\"lg\">以其清淨信樂心，<caesura/>各自修治已佛剎。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0375a02\">0375a02</span><p class=\"lg\">彼諸佛土妙莊嚴，<caesura/>遠離一切諸煩惱，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0375a03\">0375a03</span><p class=\"lg\">其地遍有諸宮林，<caesura/>解脫一切諸惡道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0375a04\">0375a04</span><p class=\"lg\">所有諸過及八難，<caesura/>彼佛國土悉皆無，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0375a05\">0375a05</span><p class=\"lg\">既修清淨佛剎已，<caesura/>眾生便即易調伏。」</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0375a06\">0375a06</span><p class=\"lg\">如是世尊天中天，<caesura/>為緊那羅說授記，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0375a07\">0375a07</span><p class=\"lg\">彼時一切諸大眾，<caesura/>聞已心皆大欣喜。<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0375001\">不分卷【聖】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0375001\">不分卷【聖】</span></p></lg><anchor type=\"circle\"/>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0375a08\">0375a08</span><cb:juan n=\"065\" fun=\"close\"><cb:jhead><title>大寶積經</title>卷第六十五</cb:jhead></cb:juan></cb:div>\r\n</cb:div></body>"
    }
  ],
  "version": "CBReader 2X v0.9.9 2026-01-21"
}